{"seq":50,"slug":"frontend-webrtc-media","title":"前端音视频与 WebRTC","stage":"DONE","category":"frontend","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-webrtc-media","rating":{"composite":3.72,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"前端音视频与-webrtc\">前端音视频与 WebRTC</h1><p>浏览器早已不只是渲染文档的工具。打开一次视频会议、看一场体育直播、给朋友发一段语音，背后都是一整套在前端运行的音视频系统：从摄像头麦克风采集原始帧，到编码压缩、跨网络传输、抗丢包与拥塞、再到对端解码渲染。本 hub 把这套系统拆成四条逐级递进的主线，让你既能理解每一层的原理，也能在真实项目里做出正确的工程取舍。</p>\n<p>第一条主线是「媒体与 WebRTC 基础」。一切从采集开始：<code>getUserMedia</code> 拿到 <code>MediaStream</code>，理解轨道、约束与设备权限是后续所有工作的地基。在此之上，WebRTC 用 <code>RTCPeerConnection</code> 把两端连成一条端到端的实时通道，而要让这条通道在 NAT 和防火墙遍布的真实网络里建立起来，又离不开信令、ICE、STUN 与 TURN。这一章回答的是「两个浏览器如何看见彼此、连上彼此」。</p>\n<p>第二条主线是「编解码与媒体管线」。实时通信解决的是「现在就要」，而点播与直播解决的是「规模化地、稳定地播放」。这条线先讲编解码器与封装格式——为什么有 H.264、VP9、AV1，容器与码流的区别在哪；再讲自适应码流，HLS 与 DASH 如何随网络波动切换清晰度，以及 LL-HLS、CMAF 把延迟压到几秒级的做法；最后落到浏览器播放器的核心 API：用 MSE 喂数据、用 EME 处理版权保护。</p>\n<p>第三条主线是「实时通信进阶」。两人通话只是起点，多人会议要靠 SFU 或 MCU 改变拓扑，用 Simulcast 和 SVC 给不同接收者发不同质量的流。除了音视频，WebRTC 的 DataChannel 还能在两端之间直接传任意数据，是游戏同步、文件直传、协同编辑的底座。而要让这一切在抖动的网络上保持流畅，质量、拥塞控制与统计监控是绕不开的硬骨头——GCC、TWCC 乃至 2026 年正在落地的 L4S 都在这一章。</p>\n<p>第四条主线是「工程实践」。Web Audio 让你在浏览器里做真正的音频处理与可视化；MediaRecorder、Insertable Streams 与 WebCodecs 把录制、实时滤镜、自定义编解码管线交到前端手里；最后是把这一切跑稳所必需的能力：用 webrtc-internals 调试、处理浏览器间的兼容差异、建立可观测性。前三章建立认知，这一章把认知变成能上线、能排障、能演进的代码。</p>\n<p>四条主线层层递进：先连得上，再压得小、播得稳，再扩展到多方与高可靠，最后落到工程落地。读完整个 hub，你应该能独立设计一套前端音视频方案，并在延迟、画质、成本与兼容之间做出有据可依的权衡。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"媒体与 WebRTC 基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-webrtc-media/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"media-capture-streams","title":"媒体捕获与 MediaStream","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-webrtc-media/foundations/media-capture-streams"},{"seq":2,"slug":"webrtc-architecture","title":"WebRTC 架构与连接模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-webrtc-media/foundations/webrtc-architecture"},{"seq":3,"slug":"signaling-ice","title":"信令、ICE、STUN 与 TURN","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-webrtc-media/foundations/signaling-ice"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"media-pipeline","title":"编解码与媒体管线","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-webrtc-media/media-pipeline","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"codecs-formats","title":"编解码器与封装格式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-webrtc-media/media-pipeline/codecs-formats"},{"seq":2,"slug":"adaptive-streaming","title":"自适应码流与 HLS/DASH","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-webrtc-media/media-pipeline/adaptive-streaming"},{"seq":3,"slug":"media-source-playback","title":"MSE、EME 与播放器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-webrtc-media/media-pipeline/media-source-playback"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"realtime","title":"实时通信进阶","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-webrtc-media/realtime","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"sfu-mcu-topologies","title":"SFU、MCU 与多方拓扑","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-webrtc-media/realtime/sfu-mcu-topologies"},{"seq":2,"slug":"datachannel-p2p","title":"DataChannel 与点对点数据","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-webrtc-media/realtime/datachannel-p2p"},{"seq":3,"slug":"quality-congestion","title":"质量、拥塞控制与统计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-webrtc-media/realtime/quality-congestion"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"工程实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-webrtc-media/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"webaudio-processing","title":"Web Audio 与音频处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-webrtc-media/practice/webaudio-processing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"recording-transforms","title":"录制、Insertable Streams 与 WebCodecs","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-webrtc-media/practice/recording-transforms"},{"seq":3,"slug":"debugging-interop","title":"调试、兼容与可观测性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-webrtc-media/practice/debugging-interop"}]}]}